# Road segment (the conveyor medium): one 2 m grid cell of ROAD. The carriers walk it with wood and stone
# (StructureSystem::tickCarriers). Physical + damageable, but players/units walk OVER it: Layer Cable collides
# only with Projectile. Spawned origin 0.25 above ground.
# SHAPE (Models/roads.obj, cobblestones 5 cm high, their base 1 cm over the ground): the centre patch of stones
# (the hub, always shown) and four strips of stones from the patch to the cell edges (the arm children, enabled by
# StructureSystem::updateArms toward connected neighbours). So a road end, a straight piece, a corner, a T and a
# crossing each get their shape, and two neighbour cells' strips meet in one joint on the cell edge. The strips are
# centred meshes moved to +-0.83: no rotation is authored.
Prefab gameCableConveyor
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer roads
		Node RoadHub
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.56 0.53 0.48
		Position 0 -0.24 0
		Scale 1
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		ContactEvents true
		Layer Cable
		CollidesWith Projectile
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 1 0.25 1
	Component GameStructure
		MeleeRadius 1
	Component Scene
		Entity
			Name ArmPX
			Enabled false
			Position 0.83 -0.24 0
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer roads
				Node RoadArmX
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.56 0.53 0.48
				Scale 1
		Entity
			Name ArmNX
			Enabled false
			Position -0.83 -0.24 0
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer roads
				Node RoadArmX
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.56 0.53 0.48
				Scale 1
		Entity
			Name ArmPZ
			Enabled false
			Position 0 -0.24 0.83
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer roads
				Node RoadArmZ
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.56 0.53 0.48
				Scale 1
		Entity
			Name ArmNZ
			Enabled false
			Position 0 -0.24 -0.83
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer roads
				Node RoadArmZ
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.56 0.53 0.48
				Scale 1
